{"c":{"181964":["Kiyoka Kudou","Male","b181964-hBQzTQAG6zIs.png","Head of the Kudou family. Kiyoka is looked upon as cold or standoffish by others, including his many past prospective fiancés. This is due to his understanding of others' motives.",1033],"181965":["Miyo Saimori","Female","b181965-VJEPa9R5ZklX.png","Eldest daughter of the Saimori family. Her mother died when she was young. She is ungifted",1145],"269669":["Kaya Saimori","Female","b269669-UGIiBu246hCL.png","Kaya is the daughter of Shinichi Saimori and Kanoko Saimori and the younger half-sister of Miyo Saimori who is currently engaged to Kouji Tatsuishi. Kaya is very spoiled, entitled, and emotionally and mentally abusive towards her half-sister. She is also rather two-faced.",32],"269670":["Yurie","Female","b269670-YlKrfHlkNiKJ.png","",122],"269671":["Kouji Tatsuishi","Male","b269671-TjQKwhasLRKY.png","",34],"308313":["Yoshito Godou","Male","b308313-QERTqIeNDg0g.jpg","",71],"308314":["Arata Tsuruki","Male","b308314-AHFYgkLsO4B2.jpg","",27],"308315":["Takaihito","Male","b308315-KLXDCMwYfZak.jpg","Second Prince of Japan.",27],"311058":["Minoru Tatsuishi","Male","b311058-AqQ7ovUlkdxl.png","",2],"311059":["Kazushi Tatsuishi","Male","b311059-bPztDY1Mo1Wc.png","",38],"311060":["Shinichi Saimori","Male","b311060-hVFgJNJXZMvp.png","",1],"311061":["Hana",null,"b311061-2xD9mx3hN3e7.png","",8],"311062":["Keiko",null,"b311062-RU2MAZTBcQY1.png","",1],"311063":["Kanoko Saimori","Female","b311063-YFnFrR9QF7W7.png","",1],"311064":["Sumi Saimori","Female","b311064-lcklVTSHFY5D.png","Sumi was Miyo's birth mother and Shinichi Saimori's first wife via an arranged marriage.",26],"312290":["Hazuki Kudou","Female","b312290-aU0Y5ljFdRTZ.png","The older sister of Kiyoka Kudou",66],"314168":["Masashi Ookaito","Male","b314168-d3wqim1B0tkB.jpg","",5],"316398":["Kinjoutei","Male","b316398-SjMGp1Cw7hVk.jpg","",2],"320984":["Iwashimizu","Male","b320984-PJA8ZRzL9nPo.png","",2],"320985":["Yoshirou Tsuruki","Male","b320985-uo3c6Jwx6lJu.